# Samuel Emmanuel — Technical Writer Portfolio

This repository contains a personal portfolio website and resume for Samuel Emmanuel, a technical writer focused on developer documentation, documentation strategy, and user-centered content.

## Project overview

The site presents:
- a professional portfolio landing page
- selected writing samples and documentation work
- resume and professional background information
- downloadable resume materials

## Files in this repository

- `index.html` — main portfolio website
- `resume.html` — resume page version
- `Samuel_Emmanuel_Resume.docx` — downloadable Word resume
- `.vscode/settings.json` — editor configuration (if present in your environment)

## How to view the portfolio

Because this is a static HTML portfolio, there is no build step required.

### Option 1: Open directly in a browser
- Open `index.html` in your browser

### Option 2: Serve locally
From the project folder, run:

```bash
python -m http.server 8000
```

Then visit:

```text
http://localhost:8000
```

## Customization

To personalize the portfolio:
- update the hero text and bio in `index.html`
- change the work samples and project cards in the main sections
- adjust resume details in `resume.html`
- replace the resume file with your latest version

## Notes

This project is designed as a lightweight static site, making it easy to deploy on GitHub Pages, Netlify, or any other static hosting service.

